Every window is generated from its own body and its own script. The html
platform caches what does not vary by window (the analysis, the __n* id map,
the esbuild bundle) across the whole compilation, so a page taking another
page's cached work is exactly the failure this guards against: each page must
carry its own text and its own updater, and none of the others'.

Which window is generated first decides which one fills the caches, and must
decide nothing else. These are the same four windows as
generate_multi_window_content_site.txtar, declared in the opposite order, so
gamma is generated first and alpha third; every page must still carry its own
content and none other's. (The two archives are not byte-identical: the __nN
ids lower assigns follow source order. What must not change is whose text
lands where.)

deny out/none/html/index.html `beta body` -- alpha's page is generated third, with beta's and gamma's work already in the caches, and still renders alpha's tree alone
deny out/none/html/index.html `gamma body` -- gamma filled the caches this page reads, which is the leak that would show here
deny out/none/html/beta.html `alpha body` -- alpha is generated after beta; its text cannot reach this page by any route
deny out/none/html/beta.html `gamma body` -- gamma is generated first here, so its static text is what beta's page could wrongly inherit
deny out/none/html/gamma.html `alpha body` -- gamma is generated first, before any other window's text exists
deny out/none/html/gamma.html `beta body` -- likewise beta's
deny out/none/html/delta.html `function String` -- delta interpolates nothing, so it gets none of the script helpers the other three registered
deny out/none/html/delta.html `addEventListener` -- delta declares no handler, so any listener on this page would be another window's

-- reversed.sngl --
import . "sngl:ui"
import . "sngl:app"

output { none { html } }

component main ui {
    var alphaCount = 0
    var betaCount = 0
    var gammaCount = 0

    window #gamma(title="Gamma", href="/gamma.html") {
        text(value="gamma body")
        button(text="press gamma", @click { gammaCount += 1 })
        text(value="gamma shows {gammaCount}")
    }
    window #beta(title="Beta", href="/beta.html") {
        text(value="beta body")
        button(text="press beta", @click { betaCount += 1 })
        text(value="beta shows {betaCount}")
    }
    window #alpha(title="Alpha", href="/") {
        text(value="alpha body")
        button(text="press alpha", @click { alphaCount += 1 })
        text(value="alpha shows {alphaCount}")
    }
    window #delta(title="Delta", href="/delta.html") {
        text(value="delta body")
    }
}
-- out/none/html/beta.html --
